<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第一幕 · 五层工程</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>这个前提不成立的地方，就是这一层管不到的地方</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "column"}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", minHeight: 94, borderBottom: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.12)"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "#1C1F23", width: 260}}>Prompt → Context</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#0F6E56", width: 300}}>前提：模型能吃上下文</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.5, flex: 1}}>→ 所以别再往 prompt 里塞事实</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", minHeight: 94, borderBottom: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.12)"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "#1C1F23", width: 260}}>Context → Harness</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#0F6E56", width: 300}}>前提：环境是受控的</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.5, flex: 1}}>→ 所以别再往 context 里写规矩</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", minHeight: 94, borderBottom: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.12)"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "#1C1F23", width: 260}}>Harness → Loop</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#0F6E56", width: 300}}>前提：单次运行受控</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.5, flex: 1}}>→ 所以不用人手动决定要不要再来一遍</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", minHeight: 94, borderBottom: "1px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.12)"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "#1C1F23", width: 260}}>Loop → Graph</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#0F6E56", width: 300}}>前提：单个 agent 受控</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.5, flex: 1}}>→ 所以不用人手动拆任务</Text></Box></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", padding: 20, background: "rgba(138,90,0,0.07)", borderRadius: 8, marginTop: 18}}>四条前提到极限处都会不成立——这是下一页给公式的伏笔。</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>10 / 36</Text></Box></Box>
